  "claim_scope": "Original actual_segment native branch supplies its own stopping receipt and selected source presentation. Original public actual successor law plus actual settled compiler recognize the literal born full root/current. Complete MaterialAt with original owner is transported into the exact canonical next emitted occurrence; typed request preserves previous native sigma and registered execution Env. The actual decoded born active Env determines a source delta on the previous completed native Trace. Existing update/effect/inverse/affine/zero-fibre APIs compute the registered request value there. Original cofinal indices recognize that exact next. The existing generated two-branch consumer hands its actual native branch to the typed canonical request/effect/inverse/literal affine/zeroiff consumers.",
  "certified_machine_facts": [
    "Three new production modules freshly pass focused trust0/werror in the independent clean library; all three main OLeans are byte-identical to frozen exports.",
    "All 30 exact original new controls and 25 printed mouths pass. Lean confirms controls 21/22/24/30 are non-Prop definitions, the remaining 26 are theorems, and control 30 preserves arbitrary Result : Sort v.",
    "Original CP112ActualBornSegment, CP106AdmissionStops and CP110InquiryDiagram gates freshly pass; original dependent erasure/two branches, paid-not-settled, scalar-erasure/distinct occurrence and full-field nonzero contracts remain intact.",
    "Original actual_segment native branch and its own localNativeReceipt identify the selected full source presentation; original public successor_valid and settled compiler recognize both literal actual next root-current equality and full root HEq.",
    "Complete original born MaterialAt is dependently transported to the exact canonical next emitted occurrence. The typed RawInputAt copies its raw, registered execution Env and source owner; source laws identify its expression with the previous completed native sigma.",
    "A record update changes only prior completed native MaterialAt increment to the source-computed decoded born Env delta, preserving original raw/environment/Trace/occurrence/complex/owner. Existing effect, inverse, pair inventory, literal affine and zero-fibre APIs compute its actual registered request readout.",
    "Actual WB var-env0 source receipt and stoppedTrace derive the old/native zero controls. Actual source writes 1/0 generate registered values 1/0 and corresponding nonzero/zero paid coimages without positivity premises or a false fresh-depth0 zero.",
    "The independent Sort-valued handler genuinely consumes original generated cofinalSegment through Sum.elim, retains both branches, and receives the exact typed canonical next request plus effect, inverse, affine/scalar and zeroiff laws.",
    "Complete new declaration type/value provenance covers 12659 logical declarations and 134 explicit target paths, including private recognition and record-update fields. Only standard three axioms; no unsafe/partial/unresolved declarations.",
    "All 1381 nonowned source snapshots match tracked HEAD with zero delta. OLean/sidecar reuse comes solely from signature-matched formally certified CP112 evidence, with zero construction-artifact reuse as fresh kernel evidence."
  ],
