  "scope_limits": {
    "actual_source": "Original actual_segment native branch supplies original AdmissionPacket, grade, localNativeReceipt and actual-node prefix. selected_actual_presentation uses those witnesses; actual_born_root_current instantiates private recognition with original public AS.successor_valid and the same stopping receipt's own settled/action witnesses.",
    "private_recognition": "settled_recognition is a generic transporter from an explicit source equality and generated-law validity. Its public caller supplies both from the original source, so no target identity/commuting certificate enters the public producer. The proof reaches full target root HEq as well as exact erased root-current equality through original debtAdmission resolution and target_root.",
    "typed_next": "MaterialAtCurrent and RequestAtCurrent are indexed by exact current.current.root.emitted(current.current.visit.current). materialAtNext transports the complete source-generated born MaterialAt by the proved actual next-current equality. registeredAtNext copies raw/environment/owner; the born material's own owner is preserved through full dependent transport.",
    "record_delta": "ActualRegisteredBornEffect.transported changes only increment to born.activeEnvironment minus T.paid(selected).environment. It retains prior raw, environment, complete state/Trace, source occurrence, relation boundary, complex and owner. Existing updated_value and full range/zero-fibre APIs evaluate the prior completed sigma under that actual source delta.",
    "environment_sigma": "The typed registered request retains born.registered.input.environment. Registered execution Env and decoded born.activeEnvironment remain distinct. Its expression is the previous completed native sigma N.expression(T.paid(selected)); fresh local born residual is a separate expression. No relation-history membership or depth0 value grants fresh zero.",
    "depth_zero": "Source Math.mathCurrent(depth) uses finiteVisit(depth+1); depth0 already contains a genuine first paid Step. The var-env0 controls derive old/native zero from their original WB material, receipt and stopped trace, not a zero-depth assumption.",
    "literal_affine": "The existing normalization certificate retains literal boundary minus constantMap(valueMap actual decoded born Env boundary). boundary_valueMap connects its scalar readout to the same actual next request; no literal coefficient word is erased or normalized away by assertion.",
    "positive_negative_controls": "The actual var-env0 WB receipt/stoppedTrace derives old and native zero. Actual source nextEnvironmentReadAt writes (1,0) or (0,0), producing registered expression value (1,0) or zero and the corresponding nonzero/zero paid coimage via registered_zero_iff. Positivity is not a hypothesis.",
    "independent_consumer": "Named control30 uses original consumeCofinalSegment on its generated cofinalSegment, retains both distance-zero and native branches, and hands the native handler its typed canonical request plus actual effect, inverse, literal affine/scalar connection and zeroiff laws. Result : Sort v belongs to the readout handler; no terminal is produced.",
    "fibres": "Full-State CP110 diagram and local native Lower W grade coefficient complex remain different dependent fibres. This certification pays exact next occurrence/owner recognition and source sigma update; it does not identify carriers or transport arbitrary physical norm/margin/payment.",
    "authority": "No new Stage, root, controller, runtime, classifier or U7/U8, no finite full carrier or global terminal. Existing actual source events, whole-ledger receipts and generated next remain authoritative.",
    "suggestions_index": "The existing official nameDenyListExt exclusions alter only suggestions retrieval/indexing; all mathematical bodies remain kernel checked at trust0."
  },
